{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind Scraper</strong> is a 2D story-driven graphic adventure about <strong>empathy</strong>, in which you'll enter a person's mind a second before their death in order to unravel their regrets and the motivations behind their choices in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just across the edge there is a new mind waiting for your help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/77c8026ff1b07c6996247f573fed536e.poster.avif?t=1767317737\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/77c8026ff1b07c6996247f573fed536e.webm?t=1767317737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/77c8026ff1b07c6996247f573fed536e.mp4?t=1767317737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind Scrapers are detectives of the underworld who enter people's minds a heartbeat before death, in order to unlock what\u2019s left behind and save human souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Robert the Mind Scraper explore Marlo's mind, piece together life fragments, and use your <strong>emotional intelligence</strong> to question the soul and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mind through objects in a dreamlike environment: each object is a gateway to travel deeper inside the mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/c470a435d7c4c195181bb71e998344f1.poster.avif?t=1767317737\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/c470a435d7c4c195181bb71e998344f1.webm?t=1767317737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/c470a435d7c4c195181bb71e998344f1.mp4?t=1767317737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to unlock new memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/f03a3c878574bc7b41f004a786799b38.avif?t=1767317737\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use memories to question the soul and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/extras/344d6d6079a60cfcd61695e0c9ebdf1b.avif?t=1767317737\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970510?t=1767317737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970510?t=1767317737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/f2ac1736203777c119d3011f10c7263cafd58a39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767317737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970510/f2ac1736203777c119d3011f10c7263cafd58a39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767317737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"c